# {{ design_vlnv }} RTL scaffold

This deterministic SystemVerilog 2017 project contains only module boundaries,
instance hierarchy, direct wire connections, and compile-safe leaf defaults.
It is not a functional hardware implementation, and every file is replaced on
regeneration.

## Verify

Install Verilator 5.x and GNU Make, then run:

```bash
make lint
```

The selected top module is `{{ top_module }}`.
